### Root
GET http://localhost:1198/


### Health Check
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/health


### Get All Products
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/products


### Get Products With Pagination
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/products?page=5&limit=5


### Search Products
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/products?search=keyboard


### Filter By Category
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/products?category=Audio


### Filter By Price Range
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/products?minPrice=2000&maxPrice=3000


### Filter By Stock
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/products?inStock=false


### Sort By Price Ascending
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/products?sort=price&order=asc


### Sort By Price Descending
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/products?sort=price&order=desc


### Combined Query
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/products?search=keyboard&category=Accessories&inStock=true&sort=price&order=asc&page=1&limit=10


### Get Product By ID
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/products/1


### Create Product
POST http://localhost:1198/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Created Wireless Charger",
  "description": "Fast wireless charger for compatible mobile devices.",
  "category": "Accessories",
  "price": 1999,
  "inStock": true
}


### Update Product
PUT http://localhost:1198/api/v1/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Premium Wireless Keyboard",
  "description": "Compact premium wireless keyboard for everyday productivity. - updated",
  "category": "Accessories",
  "price": 2999,
  "inStock": true
}


### Delete Product
DELETE http://localhost:1198/api/v1/products/1


### Invalid Product ID
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/products/abc


### Product Not Found
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/products/999


### Invalid Query
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/products?page=0&limit=500


### Invalid Route
GET http://localhost:1198/api/v1/not-found